","subtitle":"The Arboretum, 500 Alumni Drive","notes":"Follow the paved paths through the native-plant collection, bring water, and allow extra care where the route leaves pavement or turns muddy.","short_summary":"A free outdoor finish through a Kentucky native-plant collection at UK’s State Botanical Garden.","evidence_claim":"The Arboretum identifies Walk Across Kentucky as a diverse native-plant collection and states that Arboretum admission is free.","source_url":"https://arboretum.mgcafe.uky.edu/visit","source_title":"Visit The Arboretum, State Botanical Garden of Kentucky","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Arboretum grounds are open daily from dawn to dusk. The Kentucky Children’s Garden is separate and has paid admission.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Hours, event schedules, recreation eligibility, and access conditions can change; confirm them on the linked official pages before visiting."]}],"warnings":[]}
