 observatory’s public-night details, then attend the astronomy talk and telescope viewing only if weather permits.","short_summary":"A campus observatory that welcomes the public to monthly astronomy talks and telescope viewing.","evidence_claim":"UK says MacAdam Student Observatory welcomes the public to monthly SkyTalks on the second Thursday, followed by observatory viewing when weather permits.","source_url":"https://pa.as.uky.edu/dr-keith-macadam%E2%80%99s-legacy/macadam-student-observatory","source_title":"MacAdam Student Observatory","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public access is for scheduled public nights; consult the observatory for current details and weather-related changes.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"seaton-gym","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Seaton Gym","title":"Move at Seaton Gym","subtitle":"Campus Recreation summer option","notes":"Check facility hours and eligibility first, then choose a simple activity that leaves time and energy for the rest of your weekend.","short_summary":"A current Campus Recreation option while the Johnson Center is closed for summer construction.","evidence_claim":"UK Campus Recreation reports that Johnson Center is closed for summer 2026 and Seaton Gym is open and available for use.","source_url":"https://studentsuccess.uky.edu/campus-recreation","source_title":"Campus Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check facility hours and access requirements before arriving; UK states recreation facilities have eligibility rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"walk-across-kentucky","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Walk Across Kentucky","title":"End outside on Walk Across Kentucky","subtitle":"The Arboretum, 500 Alumni Drive","notes":"Follow the paved paths through the native-plant collection, bring water, and allow extra care where the route leaves pavement or turns muddy.","short_summary":"A free outdoor finish through a Kentucky native-plant collection at UK’s State Botanical Garden.","evidence_claim":"The Arboretum identifies Walk Across Kentucky as a diverse native-plant collection and states that Arboretum admission is free.","source_url":"https://arboretum.mgcafe.uky.edu/visit","source_title":"Visit The Arboretum, State Botanical Garden of Kentucky","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Arboretum grounds are open daily from dawn to dusk. The Kentucky Children’s Garden is separate and has paid admission.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Hours, event schedules, recreation eligibility, and access conditions can change; confirm them on the linked official pages before visiting."]}],"warnings":[]}
